# Software design (code touched in this repo)

- **Separation:** Simulation core (state transition), policies (dispatch/rebalance), routing adapter (OSRM/GH client), data ingest—**thin boundaries**, explicit interfaces.
- **Determinism:** Seeded RNGs; log config + git hash (or version file) for runs meant for comparison.
- **Config:** Hyperparameters and scenario knobs in one place (e.g. YAML/TOML), not scattered literals.
- **Performance:** Profile before micro-optimizing; batch routing/matrix requests when the engine allows.
- **Types & tests:** Prefer typed Python (or equivalent) for numerical code; add tests for state transitions and one end-to-end tiny scenario.
- **No speculative enterprise patterns** unless scale demands them—favor readable research code.
